  data: {
    LLM: "In a Solo bid (5 tricks), you need 3-4 trumps and a couple of side Aces. Don't bid Misere unless you have 2s, 3s, and voids in dangerous suits. In Prop/Cop, communicate with your partner via discards.\n\nThe 'Misere' Defense: Defenders must lead a suit the Misere player is void in (if known) or force them to play high. If the Misere player plays a King, you must play under it to let them win.\n\nLeading trumps against a Solo: Usually bad unless you have many. Better to force the Soloist to ruff (trump) your winning Aces in side suits to reduce their trump length.",
    Player: "In a Solo bid (5 tricks), you need 3-4 trumps and a couple of side Aces. Don't bid Misere unless you have 2s, 3s, and voids in dangerous suits. In Prop/Cop, communicate with your partner via discards.\n\nThe 'Misere' Defense: Defenders must lead a suit the Misere player is void in (if known) or force them to play high. If the Misere player plays a King, you must play under it to let them win.\n\nLeading trumps against a Solo: Usually bad unless you have many. Better to force the Soloist to ruff (trump) your winning Aces in side suits to reduce their trump length.",
